(This technical specification outlines a standardized, production-ready continuous integration and) Tj
T* (continuous deployment \(CI/CD\) pipeline for transitioning Single-Page Applications \(SPAs\)) Tj
T* (generated via Google AI Studio into static hosting environments on GitHub Pages. It resolves) Tj
T* (critical structural deployment challenges in Vite and React applications, including nested repository) Tj
T* (asset path resolutions, headless GitHub Actions authentication, secure environment variable) Tj
T* (injection \(such as VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY\), and client-side routing fallback strategies. This) Tj
T* (protocol enables deterministic, zero-touch automated deployments for AI-generated web) Tj
T* (prototypes.) Tj
ET
